  "jd": "Eight (8) years of experience as an IT professional with broad experience across multiple IT disciplines. Salesforce development experience, including Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Flows, and APIs. Salesforce Revenue Cloud and/or Salesforce CPQ implementations. Strong Apex and LWC development skills. Quote-to-Cash business process knowledge. Complex pricing, product configuration, guided selling, approval processes and quote templates experience. Experience integrating Salesforce with ERP, billing, finance, or other enterprise applications. Knowledge of Salesforce DevOps practices, including source control, CI/CD, testing, and deployment automation. Ability to translate business requirements into scalable, maintainable Salesforce solutions. Strong collaboration and communication skills with Sales, Finance, Operations, and IT stakeholders. Preferred: AI use. MuleSoft integration experience. Salesforce Platform Developer I or II Certification. Salesforce CPQ Specialist Certification. Experience with Salesforce Billing, Revenue Cloud Advanced, or subscription-based business models. Experience working in Agile development environments.",
